          "plan": {
            "A": "Explore a generic four-core parallel merge sort as an alternative to the measured task-based quicksorts: sort disjoint chunks, then merge them in parallel where profitable. Preserve signed integer ordering and the existing generation, validation, and MD5 behavior; handle small inputs and allocation failure safely. Compare full-program correctness and timings against the current best.",
